{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":68614902,"ns":0,"title":"Bridge strike","extract":"Bridge strike or tunnel strike (also known as bridge bashing) is a transport accident in which a vehicle collides with a bridge, overpass, or tunnel structure. Bridge-strike road accidents, in which an over-height vehicle collides with the underside of the structure, occur frequently and are a major issue worldwide.","description":"Type of accident","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}